WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:10.146
Hi! In editing, each line hides one mistake, and we become detectives to find it. Today we'll learn editing.

2
00:00:10.296 --> 00:00:15.378
After a short vowel, we often double the last letter: running, stopped.

3
00:00:15.528 --> 00:00:19.866
For words ending in e, drop the e before ing: making.

4
00:00:20.016 --> 00:00:24.594
After a consonant, change y to i: happier, cried.

5
00:00:24.744 --> 00:00:30.066
Practise tricky words: because, friend, beautiful.

6
00:00:30.216 --> 00:00:33.786
Check time words, then check the verb tense.

7
00:00:33.936 --> 00:00:38.130
In the simple present, one person needs a verb with s.

8
00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.106
More than one needs a plural noun.

9
00:00:41.256 --> 00:00:45.690
Check that pronouns are used correctly.

10
00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:50.898
Watch out! Run plus ing with only one n is wrong!

11
00:00:51.048 --> 00:00:54.930
Run has a short vowel, so we double the n: running.

12
00:00:55.080 --> 00:01:00.666
When editing, read each line slowly and check word by word.

13
00:01:00.816 --> 00:01:10.314
Your turn! I have two sistar. What is the correct spelling? Pause and think.

14
00:01:10.464 --> 00:01:17.178
The spelling is sister, and two needs s: sisters. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:17.328 --> 00:01:26.922
Another one! Yesterday he eat noodles. How should eat change? Pause and think.

16
00:01:27.072 --> 00:01:33.378
Yesterday means past, so eat becomes ate. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:33.528 --> 00:01:43.122
Here's another! My dog like bones. How should like change? Pause and think.

18
00:01:43.272 --> 00:01:49.074
My dog is one animal, so likes. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:49.224 --> 00:01:59.058
Try one more! The baby cryed all night. How should cryed change? Pause and think.

20
00:01:59.208 --> 00:02:06.786
Consonant plus y: change y to i and add ed: cried. Did you get it right?

21
00:02:06.936 --> 00:02:16.578
Try one more! She is makeing a card. How should makeing change? Pause and think.

22
00:02:16.728 --> 00:02:22.746
Make ends in e, so drop the e: making. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:22.896 --> 00:02:32.178
Try one more! We goed to the zoo. How should goed change? Pause and think.

24
00:02:32.328 --> 00:02:38.130
The past tense of go is went, not goed. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:48.018
Last one! Two boxs fell down. How should boxs change? Pause and think.

26
00:02:48.168 --> 00:02:54.714
Words ending in x add es: boxes. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:54.864 --> 00:03:07.338
Remember: edit line by line, word by word. For spelling, check doubling, dropping e, and y to i. For grammar, check tense, agreement, plurals and pronouns.

28
00:03:07.488 --> 00:03:12.305
After writing, be a detective and check your work!

